<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian drones are now operating over Sudan while RSF drones launch from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting reciprocal diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. An RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed dozens of Ethiopian Orthodox believers and a Kenyan, and attacks on Orthodox Christians continue in Arsi, Benishangul Gumuz and the north, with blasts heard in Addis Ababa. Seed insecurity is threatening Tigray farmers and a psychosocial and spiritual care pilot is being tested. The conflict has displaced more than 50,000 people and caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNUGVzemFrbHVZeTRzOGZXcnpNZFZ2ZVNwb3JYMDZONUZzblVDMVJBVngwcHZVRlhENUc0U19abmRjX2lpcFNiMktBa0htc1lYT0M4QU9Rd3FJSnNLSV84WnFBTGlFbDRYd2w0RC1PTUlubnA0YTh4ZU56UHdDX0dPdnFvLWdDQmIya2Z2X1h4YVh2MW14dmdIQ3BxalM5VllpUHVyV1BBRWNzRXZIekpEam5QWU04RVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNVFdzYTdoYXI3akY0U20yV3FIQUlfUnRpTUp6ZE9uZnB6U3ZYUGlnb2ZiZ2RNWjZxVDg5VkpmNWE2ZVJPUnVZTEJnZHVQTEl1XzZ5c25qZHpYa3g2amJVQlBXNkJmUzNrTkM3dXJIRnpheEI2aDNWMzJMUEpQenMxX1YzX1l4a2RzTlZMMFVPaG9CVVhwNWRsRS1jSGdJS0ZFc2l5b20wZk8?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNbnktbnBwZ3VCRGJYel9YOFRTaE9FVk5NUkdENlhIY2NLWjRqa21YVHZRd01BYTRBQWt4Y0xoeDlhVU1nOHRBeXE5SjZPXzFYbVN4ZDhSQjJEem5RbFZGSDZZZEdrRC0wbEg5S3NtX2duSWxsRjdURTN5ZkVjZ3BIVFFzU2FvNi15MWxOZU4xUFE3RkhpMGZSZ3hDeV9qZkdfMmlFTmNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOMmFoX1h5TUFBaVFMVnJ4VkpKOTA1Mzc2U3dORFdENEJ0WlIwSzdvNE1uTVNLa2REeDM2U05HZ0RNX0pLWFVJMzNz